en on the catwalks, printed and of course woven textiles.","words":[["as",132.14,132.44],["you",132.44,132.7],["will",132.7,132.88],["have",132.88,133.0],["seen",133.0,133.24],["on",133.24,133.4],["the",133.4,133.5],["catwalks,",133.5,134.6],["printed",134.6,135.24],["and",135.24,136.12],["of",136.12,136.22],["course",136.22,136.54],["woven",136.54,137.2],["textiles.",137.2,138.2]]},{"start":138.96,"end":144.16,"text":"Secondly, we also ensure that our students gain an in-depth knowledge and understanding","words":[["Secondly,",138.96,139.36],["we",140.06,140.2],["also",140.2,140.48],["ensure",140.48,140.96],["that",140.96,141.16],["our",141.16,141.3],["students",141.3,141.7],["gain",141.7,142.1],["an",142.1,142.28],["in",142.28,142.54],["-depth",142.54,142.82],["knowledge",142.82,143.26],["and",143.26,143.62],["understanding",143.62,144.16]]},{"start":144.16,"end":146.42,"text":"of related business operations.","words":[["of",144.16,144.66],["related",144.66,145.18],["business",145.18,145.64],["operations.",145.64,146.42]]},{"start":147.3,"end":152.7,"text":"We make sure that our students have sufficient hands-on experience by arranging interesting","words":[["We",147.3,147.74],["make",147.74,147.96],["sure",147.96,148.26],["that",148.26,148.44],["our",148.44,148.56],["students",148.56,149.02],["have",149.02,149.38],["sufficient",149.38,149.8],["hands",149.8,150.28],["-on",150.28,150.5],["experience",150.5,151.18],["by",151.18,151.6],["arranging",151.6,152.06],["interesting",152.06,152.7]]},{"start":152.7,"end":154.38,"text":"and relevant work placements.","words":[["and",152.7,153.02],["relevant",153.02,153.5],["work",153.5,153.84],["placements.",153.84,154.38]]},{"start":155.1,"end":160.6,"text":"The focus of the integrated component of the work placement is the global market.","words":[["The",155.1,155.66],["focus",155.66,156.02],["of",156.02,156.36],["the",156.36,156.48],["integrated",156.48,156.94],["component",156.94,157.68],["of",157.68,157.94],["the",157.94